    <section class="py-16 border-t border-gray-100">
      <div class="container mx-auto px-4">
        <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-heading font-bold text-slate-900 mb-8">Frequently asked questions on digitalisation in the lab container</h2>
          <div class="space-y-4">
            <details class="bg-slate-50 rounded-xl border border-gray-100 overflow-hidden group" open>
              <summary class="flex items-center justify-between p-6 cursor-pointer font-bold text-slate-900 hover:text-primary transition-colors">What does FDA 21 CFR Part 11 mean for the lab container?
                <svg class="w-5 h-5 shrink-0 text-primary transition-transform group-open:rotate-180" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/></svg>
              </summary>
              <div class="px-6 pb-6 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">21 CFR Part 11 is the <strong>US FDA regulation for electronic records and signatures</strong> (in force since 1997). Concretely that means: a complete audit trail to §11.10(e), unique user management, NTP/PTP timestamps, protected access to raw data, validated backups. The EU counterpart is <strong>EU-GMP Annex 11</strong> (revised 2011). The ALCOA+ principles apply on both sides.</div>
            </details>
            <details class="bg-slate-50 rounded-xl border border-gray-100 overflow-hidden group">
              <summary class="flex items-center justify-between p-6 cursor-pointer font-bold text-slate-900 hover:text-primary transition-colors">Which IoT sensors belong in a GMP container?
                <svg class="w-5 h-5 shrink-0 text-primary transition-transform group-open:rotate-180" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/></svg>
              </summary>
              <div class="px-6 pb-6 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">Mandatory: calibrated T, rH and differential-pressure sensors. For temperature-controlled GMP storage the <strong>EU-GDP guideline 2013/C 343/01</strong> requires a representative temperature-mapping study to <strong>recognised international mapping guidelines</strong>. In classified cleanrooms, particle measurement to DIN EN ISO 14644-1 is added. DAkkS calibration certificate, drift &lt;0.1 K/year. Several established manufacturers for calibrated climate and validation sensing are available on the market. Connection via Modbus TCP, OPC UA or MQTT v5.0.</div>
            </details>
            <details class="bg-slate-50 rounded-xl border border-gray-100 overflow-hidden group">
              <summary class="flex items-center justify-between p-6 cursor-pointer font-bold text-slate-900 hover:text-primary transition-colors">How does remote monitoring work during a power failure?
                <svg class="w-5 h-5 shrink-0 text-primary transition-transform group-open:rotate-180" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/></svg>
              </summary>
              <div class="px-6 pb-6 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">Three layers: edge gateway battery-backed 8–24 h (UPS to IEC 62040), redundant mobile radio (LTE-Cat-M1 / NB-IoT), escalating SMS/push notification to a stored matrix. Functionally safe to <strong>IEC 61511</strong> for the critical paths. After restoration, data catch up completely into the cloud – no audit-trail break.</div>
            </details>
            <details class="bg-slate-50 rounded-xl border border-gray-100 overflow-hidden group">
              <summary class="flex items-center justify-between p-6 cursor-pointer font-bold text-slate-900 hover:text-primary transition-colors">What is predictive maintenance concretely in the lab container?
                <svg class="w-5 h-5 shrink-0 text-primary transition-transform group-open:rotate-180" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/></svg>
              </summary>
              <div class="px-6 pb-6 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">Methodological framework: <strong>ISO 13374</strong> and <strong>ISO 17359</strong>. Vibration sensors on the extract fan report bearing wear 6–12 weeks before failure, current-draw trending on the HEPA fan shows filter clogging weeks before the dP alarm, temperature drift in the cooling warns of compressor failure. Evaluation rule-based or via ML in the cloud.</div>
            </details>
            <details class="bg-slate-50 rounded-xl border border-gray-100 overflow-hidden group">
              <summary class="flex items-center justify-between p-6 cursor-pointer font-bold text-slate-900 hover:text-primary transition-colors">Which LIMS can be integrated into a lab container?
                <svg class="w-5 h-5 shrink-0 text-primary transition-transform group-open:rotate-180" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/></svg>
              </summary>
              <div class="px-6 pb-6 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">Technically almost all established LIMS and ELN systems on the market – from a proven pharma LIMS through solutions for QC and clinical laboratories to open-source platforms. Interfaces: SiLA 2, ASTM E1394 / LIS-02, AnIML. The container comes with a prepared server cabinet, UPS, redundant network and VLAN separation. LIMS validation to GAMP 5 (ISPE 2022) is taken on by IT QM.</div>
            </details>
            <details class="bg-slate-50 rounded-xl border border-gray-100 overflow-hidden group">
              <summary class="flex items-center justify-between p-6 cursor-pointer font-bold text-slate-900 hover:text-primary transition-colors">Is a cloud connection GDPR-compliant and Schrems II-safe?
                <svg class="w-5 h-5 shrink-0 text-primary transition-transform group-open:rotate-180" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/></svg>
              </summary>
              <div class="px-6 pb-6 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">Yes, with three conditions: processing in the EU (data-centre regions in Germany), a data-processing agreement to Art. 28 GDPR with standard contractual clauses, and for US providers certification to the <strong>EU-US Data Privacy Framework</strong> (adequacy decision since 10 July 2023). Compliance anchors: <strong>BSI C5:2020</strong>, <strong>ISO 27001:2022</strong>, <strong>ISO 27017</strong>.</div>
            </details>
            <details class="bg-slate-50 rounded-xl border border-gray-100 overflow-hidden group">
              <summary class="flex items-center justify-between p-6 cursor-pointer font-bold text-slate-900 hover:text-primary transition-colors">What is the digital twin in the lab-container context?
                <svg class="w-5 h-5 shrink-0 text-primary transition-transform group-open:rotate-180" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/></svg>
              </summary>
              <div class="px-6 pb-6 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">A digital image of the container that is mirrored in operation via IoT data. Methodological framework: <strong>DIN SPEC 91345</strong> (RAMI 4.0) and the <strong>Asset Administration Shell</strong> of the IDTA. Benefit: CFD flow simulation before construction, virtual training, energy optimisation in live operation. 5–8 % extra effort at first fit-out, 15–25 % lower operating costs over 10 years.</div>
            </details>
          </div>
        </div>
